[I] A mod-like music player ported into an XMMS Plugin

[T] libmodplug is a library for decoding and rendering tracker module music
[T] such as MOD, S3M, XM and IT, based on the public domain ModPlug sound
[T] engine by Olivier Lapicque. It was split out of the modplug-xmms project
[T] and is used by many media players.

[U] https://modplug-xmms.sourceforge.net

